#* {{quote-book|ang|text=''Hwǣr cōm '''mearg'''? Hwǣr cōm mago? · Hwǣr cōm māþþumġyfa?<br/>Hwǣr cōm symbla ġesetu? · Hwǣr sindon seledrēamas?<br/>Ēalā beorht bune! · Ēalā byrnwiga!<br/>Ēalā þēodnes þrym! · Hū sēo þrāg ġewāt,<br/>ġenāp under nihthelm, · swā hēo nō wære.''|t=Whither did '''the horse''' come? Whither did the man come? Whither did the treasure-giver come?<br/>Whither did the seats of feasts come? Where are the hall-joys?<br/>Alack and alas, bright cup! Alack and alas, mailed warrior!<br/>Alack and alas, the army of the king! How did the time pass,<br/>grow dark under the cover of night, as if it never did.|title=The Wanderer|year=10th century}}

